{
  "run_id": "PMC10759803__scimon__mixed__s2",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Composite structures that balance the properties of different phases can concurrently improve strength and ductility in high-entropy alloys.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "AlCoCrFeNi2.1 is an eutectic high-entropy alloy with a pseudo-binary nature.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial material is as-cast AlCoCrFeNi2.1 EHEA.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is to design a composite structure based on the alloy's pseudo-binary nature.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant testing conditions include room temperature and temperatures up to 700 °C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pseudo-binary microstructure contains a NiAl-rich B2 phase and a Co/Cr/Fe-rich fcc phase.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pseudo-binary phase arrangement permits the design of a composite structure that balances the low ductility of NiAl with the high strength of the fcc phase.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Balancing the properties of the B2 and fcc phases produces a synergistic improvement in strength and ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "AlCoCrFeNi2.1 exhibits high fracture strength and high ductility at room temperature relative to NiAl and NiAl/Cr(Mo) eutectic alloys.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "High fracture strength and high ductility are expected throughout the stated temperature range up to 700 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Conventional NiAl-based alloys exhibit low ductility at room temperature and low strength at high temperatures.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed mechanism depends on the specific fcc and B2 phase constitution.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The mechanism responsible for the alloy's low elastic limit is unclear.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is uncertain whether the pseudo-binary composite-design concept extends to other alloy systems.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Processing routes must be optimized to obtain the desired microstructure and properties.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
